model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Pool AppPages queries group concurrent SQL through the existing host transport. Every live authority predicate and both before/after fences remain. Independent control, exact source and retained presentation reads may overlap, but no authorization verdict is cached and no data escapes a refused control read. The full public five-account query retains all exact source executions and reports within 80 sequential SQL wire waits under injected query latency. A protocol observer excludes connection login, captures pipelined statements, and preserves the existing presentation-path bound."
    }
  }
}
